title: "Research on the Denominator-Weighted Shapiro Cyclic Sum and Efficient Solution Algorithms"
abstract: >-
  Source code and manuscript for the study of the denominator-weighted Shapiro
  cyclic sum F(x,p) = sum_i x_i / (p x_{i+1} + q x_{i+2}) with p + q = 1.
  The work extends the Bushell-Ando structural characterization of minimizers
  to the denominator-weighted case, reduces the computation of the minimum
  P(n,p) to finitely many polynomial equation systems, and proposes a Riemannian
  BFGS (RBFGS) algorithm on the unit sphere with oscillatory-solution detection
  and restart.
